# .NET Core and Visual Studio generated files

## Build output folders
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## IDE-specific files (Visual Studio, VS Code, Rider)
.vs/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

## Configuration files that might contain secrets
# Usually appsettings.json is checked in, but developer-specific overrides are not.
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.Template.json

# User-secrets files (a common pattern for local secrets)
secrets.json

## Log files
*.log
logs/

## Runtime files
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb

## Miscellaneous
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NuGet packages folder (legacy pattern, but good to have)
[Pp]ackages/

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/